        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Batch a List\n\nGroups a stream of items into fixed-size batches. Use this pattern for rate-limited or per-call priced services, sending one request per batch instead of one per item.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Source list\" holds seven letters. \"Fan out\" emits them one at a time as a stream. \"2 Batch by 3\" collects them into groups of three, and \"3 Batches\" shows the groups.\n\n**Try this:** Set size on \"2 Batch by 3\" to 2 and run again to see how the last, shorter batch is handled."
        },
